Package: nestris-terminal
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Retroverse <https://retroverse.at>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/oe7set/nestris-terminal
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), passwd, init-system-helpers, libxcb-cursor0, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xinput0, libxcb-xkb1, libxcb-shm0, libxcb-sync1, libxcb-xfixes0, libx11-xcb1, libegl1, libgl1, libopengl0, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libdbus-1-3, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libnss3, libnspr4, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxrandr2, libxtst6, libxshmfence1, libxkbfile1, libgbm1, libdrm2, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libcups2t64 | libcups2
Recommends: network-manager
Description: Retroverse Terminal - player terminal of the Retroverse Tetris tournament
 Touch kiosk for player registration, statistics, replays and the highscore,
 with a USB RFID card reader (nestris-rfid-reader, protocol v2). Client of
 NestrisLTM. Includes esptool (GPL-2.0-or-later) as a separate program for
 reader firmware updates.
 .
 Updates from the terminal's hidden menu are installed by a root helper
 (nestris-terminal-update.path); the kiosk user must be in the group
 "nestris-terminal" for that and in "dialout" for the card reader.
